 +created, before you use MSDOS or whatever to format it.  Type:
 +   dd if=/dev/zero of=/dev/hdXY bs=512 count=1
 +where hdXY is the relevant partition, eg, hda1 for the first partition of
 +the first (IDE) disk.
  
