-----BEGIN PGP SIGNED MESSAGE-----

magicfilter 1.2 has been released.  The only major improvement in this
version is support for LPRng, which passes lots of useful information
to the printer filters that BSD lpd doesn't.  There are also a number
of small tweaks to the filters database, including a reorganization
which should make it easier to add new filters to the database.

For you who don't know what magicfilter is, it is a printer filter for
lpd which will automatically convert just about any data format.  It
is largely self-configuring.

magicfilter-1.2 is at:

	ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/Incoming/magicfilter-1.2.tar.gz

and should be moved to

	ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/system/Printing/magicfilter-1.2.tar.gz

soon.

By sheer coincidence, the size of magicfilter-1.2.tar.gz (53176)
contains the exact same digits as magicfilter-1.1b.tar.gz (51367), but
in different order!

	-hpa
